@startuml state-diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam StateBorderColor #8E44AD
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F5EEF8
skinparam ArrowColor #8E44AD
skinparam fontName "Helvetica"
skinparam StateAttributeFontSize 11

title Radovid Bot — Game Session State Diagram

[*] --> IDLE : Bot starts / no session in channel

state IDLE {
  IDLE : No active game session\nin the channel.
  IDLE : Waiting for /radovid start.
}

state PENDING {
  PENDING : Session created by host.
  PENDING : Waiting for Player 2\nto join (max 5 min).
}

state ACTIVE {
  ACTIVE : Both players joined.
  ACTIVE : Game loop running.
  ACTIVE : Rounds in progress.
  ACTIVE : AI Game Master generating\nprompts & feedback.
}

state COMPLETED {
  COMPLETED : All rounds finished\nor /radovid end issued.
  COMPLETED : XP awarded, progress saved.
  COMPLETED : Summary displayed.
}

state CANCELLED {
  CANCELLED : Session was aborted.
  CANCELLED : No XP awarded.
}

state PAUSED {
  PAUSED : [Future Feature]\nGame temporarily paused.
  PAUSED : Both players must\nresume with /radovid resume.
}

' Primary transitions
IDLE --> PENDING : /radovid start [game_type]\n(host creates session)

PENDING --> ACTIVE : Player 2 joins\nvia /radovid join

PENDING --> CANCELLED : 5-minute timeout\n(no Player 2)

PENDING --> CANCELLED : Host issues\n/radovid end

ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : /radovid end issued\n(by host or admin)\nor max rounds reached

ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : Unexpected error\nor bot restart\nduring session

COMPLETED --> IDLE : Channel ready\nfor new session

CANCELLED --> IDLE : Channel ready\nfor new session

' Future / optional transitions
ACTIVE --> PAUSED : /radovid pause\n[future feature]

PAUSED --> ACTIVE : /radovid resume\n[future feature]

PAUSED --> CANCELLED : 30-min pause timeout\n[future feature]

' Notes
note right of PENDING
  During PENDING state:
  • Bot shows join embed in channel
  • Timer runs for 5 minutes
  • Ollama pre-generates opening prompt
  • Only one PENDING session per channel
end note

note right of ACTIVE
  During ACTIVE state:
  • game_session.status = 'active'
  • game_rounds inserted per round
  • feedback_logs saved per response
  • Both players must be in same channel
end note

note right of COMPLETED
  On COMPLETED:
  • game_session.ended_at = epoch ms
  • user_progress updated (XP, level, streak)
  • achievements checked & awarded
  • feedback_logs finalized
end note

note bottom of PAUSED
  PAUSED is a planned future state.
  Not implemented in MVP.
  SQLite status value reserved: 'paused'
end note

@enduml
